{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o049a","title":"徐晃卒徐盖嗣","accounts":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o049a-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"徐晃卒徐盖嗣","evidence":["zhangle-e-o049a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0180","role":"卒","evidence":["zhangle-e-o049a-q"]},{"person":"zhangle-p0041","role":"嗣爵","evidence":["zhangle-e-o049a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":227,"label":"太和元年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhangle-y227","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhangle-q-o049","basis":"太和元年"},"evidence":["zhangle-e-o049a-q","zhangle-q-o049","houfei-q-o022","mingdi-q-o004","mingdi-q-o008","mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o049a-q","source_order":[17,174,"O049a"],"order":3601}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0180","name":"徐晃","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhangle-p0041","name":"徐盖","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-o022","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-31288da490b4d6270504","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年三月，以中山魏昌之安城乡户千〖2〗，追封逸，谥曰敬侯；嫡孙像，袭爵。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-76fba510250937628a99","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：太和二年（公元 228）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-38a74578b09178cb1fd4","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"mingdi-q-o004","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3d867ec3331f738aeaf5","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年春正月，郊祀武皇帝，以配天；宗祀文皇帝于明堂，以配上帝〖1〗。分江夏南部，置江夏南部都尉。西平麹英反，杀临羌令、西都长〖2〗。遣将军郝昭、鹿磐，讨斩之。二月，辛未〖3〗，帝耕于籍田。辛巳〖4〗，立文昭皇后寝庙于邺。丁亥〖5〗，朝日于东郊。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123},{"id":"mingdi-q-o008","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-bec9198de0001b0aa26c","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，宣王攻破新城。斩达，传其首〖2〗。﹝一﹞分新城之上庸、武陵、巫县为上庸郡〖3〗，锡县为锡郡。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55},{"id":"zhangle-e-o049a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-c9e453db6319002d476f","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年薨，谥曰壮侯。子盖嗣。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15},{"id":"zhangle-q-o049","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-c9e453db6319002d476f","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年薨，谥曰壮侯。子盖嗣。盖薨，子霸嗣。明帝分晃户，封晃子、孙二人列侯。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
